{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012202001:1":{"text":"길을 잘못 든 게 아닐까? 이게 어떻게 연인의 소원일 수 있지?!","source_cn":"我们是不是走错路了？这里怎么可能是情人之愿呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2042E786B48DB767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012202002:1":{"text":"이렇게 끔찍한 곳은 원수의 소원이라고 불러야 한다고! 땅의 부패가 타란 마을보다 심해…","source_cn":"这么可怕的地方，叫仇人之愿才对吧！地面的腐化竟然比塔兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x535C93DC8F9A5292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012202003:1":{"text":"지맥이 마력의 흐름을 결정하는데, 마치 얽히고설킨 강물 같아서 흐름을 파악하기 어려워.","source_cn":"地脉决定了魔力的流动，它就像错综复杂的河流，难以摸清走势。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0D2A337BD4B15B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012202004:1":{"text":"이곳 지맥은 황혼의 나무와 직접 연결되어 있어 영향이 더 두드러진 것 같아.","source_cn":"看来，这里的地脉与流荧树直接相连，因此受到的影响也更加明显。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE6A2DD02C2FFFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012202005:1":{"text":"하임 할머니가 말한 휴윈 양은? 연인의 소원이 이 지경이 됐는데… 아직 있을까?","source_cn":"茴姆婆婆提到的那位伊温小姐呢？情人之愿都变成这样了……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C1FC95FB222F29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012202006:1":{"text":"있을 거예요. 비가 아직 멈추지 않았으니.","source_cn":"她在，因为雨没有停。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD5691FFA2F5C1DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012202007:1":{"text":"그러네. 아주 따뜻한 비야. 마음속 잡념을 말끔히 씻어내리는 것 같아.","source_cn":"是啊，好温暖的雨。这场雨仿佛能洗净心中所有杂念。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x094E8E21DC1C6323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012202008:1":{"text":"그런데... 휴원은 어디 있을까? 이 근처에 사람 그림자도 안 보이는데.","source_cn":"可是……她在哪呢？这附近连个人影都看不着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C038A5091436A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012202009:1":{"text":"이름을 불러볼까? 하지만 하임 할머니는 휴원이 겁이 많다고 했으니, 이렇게 하면 오히려 놀라 도망가지 않을까?","source_cn":"我们喊她的名字试试？但茴姆婆婆说她很胆小，这么做会不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25551A588D7B25B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012202010:1":{"text":"아무래도 신중히 움직이는 게 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"我建议，不要轻举妄动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5A48A1C32068E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012202011:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">호수 중앙에 있는 정자</style>에 강력한 마력이 모여 있으니, 먼저 가서 살펴보죠.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>湖心那座亭子里</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD110D2ACFBCC58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}}